SUMMARY:FREE CONCERT: Deni Bonet & Chris Flynn
DESCRIPTION:Join us October 10th for an unforgettable evening with Deni 
 Bonet and Chris Flynn! Known for creating a sound that feels far bigger 
 than two musicians\, this dynamic duo combines Deni’s soaring\, 
 expressive violin with Chris’s driving guitar and vocals. Having 
 performed on legendary stages from Carnegie Hall to Mountain Stage\, they 
 bring incredible musicianship\, warmth\, and playful audience interaction 
 to every show. Come enjoy an evening of joyful music and connection!
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Performance
UID:LibCal-10270-17618049
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17618049
