SUMMARY:STORYTIME & STARTER
DESCRIPTION:Gather together for a cozy story time featuring Bread Is Love 
 by Pooja Makhijani\, a celebration of bread\, family\, culture\, and the 
 ways we share love through food. After the story\, families will get 
 hands-on as they learn about sourdough and create their own starter to take 
 home. A playful\, sensory activity for little bakers and their grown-ups to 
 enjoy together!\n\n \n\nRegistration is required. All littles must have 
 their own registration!! PLEASE NOTE: that each little should have an adult 
 to accompany them throughout the program.
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Children's Library\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-17621133
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17621133
