DTSTART:20261020T150000Z
DTEND:20261020T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261020T000000Z
SUMMARY:Medicare & You Educational Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a free\, informative workshop where we’ll break 
 down the basics of Medicare in a clear\, easy to understand way.\n\nAre you 
 turning 65? Already on Medicare? Disabled? Or helping a loved one navigate 
 their options? Topics We’ll Cover:\n\n✓ When and how to enroll\n\n✓ 
 Understanding Parts A\, B\, C & D\n\n✓ Medicare Supplement vs. Advantage 
 Plans\n\n✓ Avoiding late penalties\n\n✓ How to help a parent or spouse 
 with Medicare\n\nLight refreshments will be served. This is an educational 
 event– no sales\, just guidance.\n\nPresented by Tina Marie Cappabianca | 
 Founder of Retiree Solutions | Medicare Specialist RSVP encouraged but not 
 required. All are welcome!\n\nFor questions\, contact: Bloomfield Public 
 Library at 973-566-6200
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Quiet Study\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-17771996
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17771996
END:VEVENT
