SUMMARY:Adult Dungeons & Dragons
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our Adult Dungeons & Dragons one-shot game!\n\nOur 
 game is running on D&D 5e (based in 2014 edition)! Character Level 5 - 
 premades will be available\, or if players want to bring their own 
 characters\, they will be able to bring in their own.\n\n**Main things for 
 people bringing their own characters are:\n\n\n	Character made using 
 official D&D published material for 5e\n	Characters cannot have magic or 
 custom items from other campaigns\n	Characters must be level 5\n\n\nNo 
 previous playing experience necessary! Spaces are limited. Register by 
 emailing jennie.sudia@bloomfield.bccls.org to reserve your spot!
