SUMMARY:HALLOWEEN PARTY @ Bloomfield Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:🎃 Ghouls Just Wanna Have Fun! 👻\nJoin us for a 
 spook-tacular time at the Bloomfield Farmers Market!\n\n🕸️ When: 
 Tuesday\, October 27th\n🕒 Time: 3:30 PM – 6:30 PM\n📍 Where: 90 
 Broad Street @ the Bloomfield Farmers Market\n\nGet ready for a fang-tastic 
 afternoon full of:\n🕷️ Creepy & kooky games\n🍬 Bewitching 
 treats\n🎁 Eerie-sistible prizes\n\n🧛 Costume Contest\nCome dressed to 
 distress! We’re hosting a costume contest for both adults and kids—so 
 grab your best ghoul-friends and show off your hauntingly good 
 style!\n\nWhether you're a little monster or a grown-up ghost\, there's 
 something for everyone. It’s going to be a howling good time—don’t 
 miss out!
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-17618060
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17618060
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261027T210000Z
DTEND:20261027T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20261027T000000Z
SUMMARY:Market Activities with Ms. Lisa and Ms. Cheryl
DESCRIPTION:All children are invited to join us at our library table from 
 5-6pm during the Bloomfield Community Farmers Market!  We will feature 
 special themed crafts\, games\, and other fun activities while the market 
 is active.\n\nThe Farmers Market is on Tuesdays from 3:30-6:30pm and runs 
 from June 2 - October 27.
LOCATION:Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Craft, Games, Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-16940909
