SUMMARY:Vitalant Blood Drive
DESCRIPTION:Scary Good Giveaway!  No tricks\, just treats.\n\nDonate in 
 Oct. to help patients who rely on blood donations and you’ll be entered 
 to win one of two $10\,000 gift cards.*\n\nSchedule your appointment today. 
 Make an appointment at vitalant.org & use zip code: 07003 or call 
 877-25-VITAL\n\nBLOOMFIELD LIBRARY BLOOD DRIVE ON BLOODBMOBILE\n\n90 Broad 
 Street Bloomfield\, NJ 07003\n\nFriday\, October 30\, 2026\n\n11:00 a.m. to 
 2:15 p.m
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-17638627
