SUMMARY:Halloween Movie Marathon & Trick-or-Treating in the Library!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a SPOOKY movie marathon this Halloween! \n\n9:30AM 
 - 10AM: It's The Great Pumpkin\, Charlie Brown! (Rated G)\n\n10AM - 12PM: 
 Coco (Rated PG)\n\n12PM - 1:30PM: The Nightmare Before Christmas (Rated 
 PG)\n\n2:30PM - 3PM: Hotel Transylvania (Rated PG) \n\nWe will also be 
 having Trick-or-Treating until 2pm (while supplies last)! It's going to be 
 a real GHOUL time! Hope to see you there 👻🎃
