SUMMARY:Children's Local Author Visit
DESCRIPTION:Children's author Nicole Castrovinci returns with her newest 
 kids' book\, Snowballed!  Adventures abound when “a snowflake lands on a 
 mountaintop. It flips and flops\, tumbling down into the valley below. 
 That’s when things really begin to snowball!”  All children and their 
 grownups are welcome to join us for this fun read-aloud\, and to hear about 
 the author's journey from idea to published book.  This event takes place 
 in the youth area of the main library.
